    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.formula activity=MxEs7KnCVGemObHx]], one [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=MxEs7KnCVGemObHx]] [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=MxEs7KnCVGemObHx]] the kuo-toa can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=MxEs7KnCVGemObHx]] feet. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition until the net is destroyed (AC 10; HP 5; Immunity to Bludgeoning, Poison, and Psychic damage). A creature can take an action to make a [[/skill ath 10]] check to free itself or another creature in a net within 5 feet, destroying the net on a success.</p>",
